    "body": "Hello,\r\n\r\nI like this cookie consent manager. But what do I need (polyfill, shims, addons), that Klaro will work on older browsers to.\r\nI would support Android 4.x, older iOS (iPhone 6) and InternetExplorer 9, 10 and 11. My websites (for local community) is also used by persons with older hard- and software.\r\n\r\nThe normal build step (descriped in Readme) does not include required parts for older systems.\r\nExample: Symbol, Map not defined, klaro.version unsupported, script.dataset (currentScript) null object ...\r\n\r\nRegards\r\nMichael",
